---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BinaryCodeCalculator from '../../components/tools/BinaryCodeCalculator';

title: "在线原码/反码/补码计算器"
description: "免费在线原码、反码、补码计算器，支持 8位/16位/32位 二进制转换，帮助学习计算机组成原理和数字逻辑。"
technologies: "React, TailwindCSS"
category: "tool"
order: 26
---

<Layout title="在线原码/反码/补码计算器" description="免费在线原码、反码、补码计算器，支持 8位/16位/32位 二进制转换，帮助学习计算机组成原理和数字逻辑。">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        原码/反码/补码计算器
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        输入十进制整数，自动计算其在计算机中的二进制表示形式。支持 8 位、16 位和 32 位字长，清晰展示符号位与数值位。
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
      <BinaryCodeCalculator client:only="react" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-binary"><rect x="14" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="2"/><rect x="6" y="4" width="4" height="6" rx="2"/><path d="M6 20h4"/><path d="M14 10h4"/><path d="M6 14h2v6"/><path d="M14 4h2v6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">全面覆盖</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">一键计算原码 (Sign-Magnitude)、反码 (Ones' Complement) 和补码 (Two's Complement)。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"/><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"/><path d="M15 2v2"/><path d="M15 20v2"/><path d="M2 15h2"/><path d="M2 9h2"/><path d="M20 15h2"/><path d="M20 9h2"/><path d="M9 2v2"/><path d="M9 20v2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">多位宽支持</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">支持切换 8 位、16 位、32 位模式，模拟不同计算机架构下的存储方式。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">教学辅助</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">附带详细的原码、反码、补码定义说明，是学习计算机基础知识的好帮手。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
